<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Interactive FAQ</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .faq-container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
        }

        .faq-question {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .faq-question:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        .faq-answer {
            display: none;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }

        .faq-answer.active {
            display: block;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="faq-container">
        <h1>College Help Portal - FAQ</h1>

        <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-question">1. What is the college timing?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                The college timing is generally from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-question">2. How can I get my college ID card?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                You can collect your ID card from the college administration office.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-question">3. How can I pay my college fees?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                College fees can be paid through the available online or offline payment methods.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-question">4. Where can I check my exam schedule?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                You can check the exam schedule on the college notice board or student portal.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-question">5. How can I contact the college office?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
                You can contact the college office during working hours.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Select all FAQ questions
        const questions = document.querySelectorAll(".faq-question");

        // Add click event to each question
        questions.forEach(function(question) {

            question.addEventListener("click", function() {

                // Find the answer corresponding to the question
                const answer = question.nextElementSibling;

                // Show or hide the answer
                answer.classList.toggle("active");
            });

        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
